  "document": "List of Waterloo Road characters (series 9)\nThe following is a list of characters who first appear in the ninth series of the BBC school drama \"Waterloo Road\", in order of first appearance. The ninth series consists of twenty episodes, first broadcast from 5 September 2013 to 12 March 2014. With the majority of new cast members already introduced in Series Eight, Science Teacher Sue Lowsley completes the main cast in episode one. New pupil characters include twins Lenny and Lisa Brown, Darren Hughes, Shaznay Montrose and Archie Wong. Episode ten sees the first appearance of Sue's sister Vix Spark, who continues in a supporting role for the rest of the series. Episode eleven introduces PE teacher Hector Reid to the main cast, and pupil Gabriella Wark to the supporting cast."
